@startuml
mainframe Venue entry check-in

actor Customer
actor Attendant
participant orderEndpoint
participant eventEndpoint

group prepare ticket token
Customer --> orderEndpoint: GET /orders
Customer --> orderEndpoint: GET /orders/{orderId}
Customer --> orderEndpoint: POST /orders/{orderId}/token
note over Customer, orderEndpoint
The order must be paid. The request supplies
one seatId and returns a JWT for QR display.
end note
end

group validate event and session
Attendant --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}
Attendant --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/sessions
Attendant --> eventEndpoint: GET /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}
Attendant --> Customer: Scan QR token
end

group redeem ticket token
Attendant --> eventEndpoint: POST /events/{eventId}/sessions/{sessionId}
note over Attendant, eventEndpoint
Supply the JWT in the token header. The service
validates eventId, sessionId, seatId, and expiration,
then marks the matching seat checked in.
end note
Customer --> orderEndpoint: GET /orders/{orderId}
note over Customer, orderEndpoint
The updated seat state is returned with the order.
end note
end

@enduml
